{"source":"DataDog/integrations-extras@20d3ceeaf342b8c9f6211dc9df9ea3d382dbb692 datazoom","overview":"Datazoom is a video data platform that gathers data from endpoints through an ecosystem of collectors.\n\nThe [Datazoom Datadog Connector][1] sends collector data to Datadog, where you can query the data in your [Log Explorer][3].\n\nDatazoom sends data set at the INFO level.\n\n[1]: https://help.datazoom.io/hc/en-us/articles/360042494512-Datadog\n[3]: /logs","setup":"### Installation\n\nThe Datazoom integration emits logs to Datadog. No installation is required on the Datadog side.\n\n### Configuration\n\n- Visit Datazoom's integration [documentation][1] for details on how to configure the Datazoom Datadog Connector.\n\n### Dashboard\n\nSee the [Datazoom logs dashboard][4].\n\n[1]: https://help.datazoom.io/hc/en-us/articles/360042494512-Datadog\n[4]: /dashboard/lists/preset/3?q=datazoom","troubleshooting":"Need help? Contact [Datadog support][2].\n\n[2]: https://docs.datadoghq.com/help/","furtherReading":"Additional helpful documentation, links, and articles:\n\n- [Blog: Monitor Datazoom telemetry with Datadog][5]\n\n[5]: https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/monitor-datazoom/","resources":[{"type":"blog","url":"https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/monitor-datazoom/"}],"metrics":[],"logFacets":[{"name":"Browser","path":"http.useragent_details.browser.family","facetType":"list","group":"Web Access"},{"name":"OS","path":"http.useragent_details.os.family","facetType":"list","group":"Web Access"},{"name":"Country ISO Code","path":"network.client.geoip.country.iso_code","facetType":"list","group":"Geoip"},{"name":"Subdivision ISO Code","path":"network.client.geoip.subdivision.iso_code","facetType":"list","group":"Geoip"},{"name":"Subdivision Name","path":"network.client.geoip.subdivision.name","facetType":"list","group":"Geoip"},{"name":"User ID","path":"usr.id","facetType":"list","group":"User"},{"name":"Longitude","path":"network.client.geoip.location.longitude","facetType":"list"